config FRANKENDRICE
	tristate "FrankenDrICE E810 Network Driver"
	depends on PCI
	depends on PCI_MSI
	select NET_DEVLINK
	help
	  Clean-sheet driver for Intel E810 network adapters, informed by
	  architectural patterns studied from mlx5 and ice/irdma.

	  This driver supports the following Intel Ethernet adapters:
	    - E810-C (100GbE QSFP28, SFP28, Backplane)
	    - E810-XXV (25GbE QSFP28, SFP28, Backplane)

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called frankendrice.
